# Mayor Arse — gives the water quest (Chesburg, house 3). Format: dialogue/dialogue_parser.gd
@speaker Mayor Arse

# Most advanced story state first.
@when quest_done_water_for_the_desert -> thanks
@when water_quest_accepted -> reminder

== offer ==
[wave]Oh dear[/wave]...[pause=0.8] [i]you[/i] actually came!
> What did you call me here for? -> info

== info ==
[sad][wave]My[/wave] old friend, [color=#c98600]Mayor Cox[/color][/sad], from the [wave][color=#c98600]Desert Village[/color][/wave] has told [wave]me[/wave] that his [whisper]little[/whisper] [color=#c98600]village[/color] has been suffering from a month-long drought.
> So? -> info_2

== info_2 ==
It [shake]would[/shake] be great help [bounce]diplomatically[/bounce] if you can, deliver some of our [color=#1478d6eb]water spirits[/color] to their village to sell them.
> Wait, what spirits? -> water_spirit_info
> Why me specifically? -> why_me_info

== why_me_info ==
[wave]I[/wave] am giving [i]you[/i] something to do? Shouldn't [i]you[/i] be like[pause=0.8], [rainbow]happy[/rainbow] to get orders from [wave]me[/wave]?
> Ughhhh, fine -> accepted [set water_quest_accepted]
> No? -> rejected

== water_spirit_info ==
In [wave]my[/wave] well. [wave]I[/wave] have had them for a long time, [wave]plenty[/wave] in fact. They are the [i]reason[/i] why [wave]we[/wave] never have to worry about [color=#1478d6eb]water[/color] problems.
> But why me? -> why_me_info

== rejected ==
[shake]N-[pause=0.5]No?[/shake][pause=0.8] [angry]Listen here[/angry] young boy! This is why [shake][bounce]NOBODY[/bounce][/shake] in this [color=#FF0000]town[/color] likes you. What [wave]I[/wave], am doing is [wave]giving[/wave] you an opportunity to prove [i]your[/i] worth to this [color=#FF0000]town[/color].
> Ughhhh, fine -> accepted [set water_quest_accepted]

== accepted ==
[give lantern] Splendid! Take this [color=#ffd966]lantern[/color], jump into the well and keep going down. The spirits are at the very bottom. Bring [color=#1478d6eb]them[/color] to the [wave][color=#c98600]Desert Village[/color][/wave]'s [color=#c98600]mayor[/color] and tell her [color=#ffff00]200 gold[/color] each.

== reminder ==
Still here? Jump into the well and keep going down. The spirits are at the very bottom. Bring [color=#1478d6eb]them[/color] to the [wave][color=#c98600]Desert Village[/color][/wave]'s [color=#c98600]mayor[/color] and tell her 200 gold each.

== thanks ==
The desert has water again, thanks to you. Chesburg is proud. Take a rest. You've earned it.
